// Page Intro Text :
"P1863211711" "I am <color yellow>Nuada</color>, one of the Tuatha leaders. We have been chasing down this vile woman for some time in our own realm. She has broken through to this one, and we feel it is our responsibility to bring her in.<br><br>If you are going to go in, then you may have the aid of my Tuatha. Choose which ones you wish to command, and I shall issue your wishes to them."
// Answer Text :
"P3335199676" "Order the first group."
// Answer Text :
"P1133813733" "Order the second group."
// Answer Text :
"P1205874306" "Order the third group."
// Answer Text :
"P3408234535" "Order the fourth group."
// Answer Text :
"P2676615649" "That's all for now."
// Page Main Text :
"P320032037" "Tell me what you wish from my Tuatha, and I shall make it happen."
// Page Alpha Text :
"P1616386044" "What orders do you wish to give to the first group?"
// Answer Text :
"P1287542156" "Patrol the outer part of Agincourt."
// Answer Text :
"P2507733396" "Patrol the inner area of Agincourt."
